[h1]OpenZone Trader[/h1]
A barter trader in the manner of STALKER 2 for OpenZone servers: what you buy and what you sell on one screen, with the deal's sum shown before you confirm. Every trader, category, price and banknote is the administrator's JSON. Part of the OpenZone series, made for the whole Ukrainian DayZ community.

[b]What you get[/b]
[list]
[*]One screen: the trader's goods and your things side by side, a basket on each side, your character with every worn slot, double click or drag to move a thing into the deal. The server prices the whole deal and checks the room in your bags before anything changes hands.
[*]Weapons and gear with their parts: a rifle is sold with its scope, magazine and rounds, each paid by its own price; keep any part or the rounds with a double click. Goods can come with parts, and an empty slot shows the goods that fit it, for what you buy and for what you carry.
[*]Item money: any mod's banknotes by class and value, change in the largest notes, prices always rounded in the trader's favour. A change tab turns notes into the notes you need, at face value. A bank mod plugs in with a glue pbo.
[*]Traders at points: an object (a stall, a counter), a character dressed from a preset, or a thing that already stands on the map; one Trade action within the point's radius. The characters take no damage and cannot be looted or restrained.
[*]Locks and discounts on the word of any mod: factions, posts and leaders through OpenZone Core, research through its own glue pbo, and any other mod can bring its own kind. A missing mod never blocks trade and never gives money away.
[*]Stock and licences: a trader can keep a shelf whose prices follow how full it is, and licences, sold by a trader or granted by the administrator, open categories and traders.
[*]Coming from TraderPlus: the admin window imports its files, a dry run with a report first.
[*]A card for every thing, a price list, trying wearables on before you buy, English and Ukrainian.
[/list]

[b]Needs[/b] Community Framework and OpenZone Core. Optional: OpenZone Trader for VPP Admin Tools (the trader's pages in the admin window), OpenZone Trader Research (the research gate), OpenZone Trader TraderPlus (the TraderPlus bank as money).

[b]For administrators[/b] Three files in [i]profile/OpenZone[/i]: OZ_Trader_Settings.json (money, notes, condition factors, gate switches), OZ_Trader_Goods.json (categories and prices), OZ_Trader_Traders.json (the points). The repository's examples folder holds a working set and its notes.

Source: github.com/OpenZone-DayZ/openzone-trader. Licence: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 with the series' NOTICE.

